jenkins/<SuiteName>.cmd
Scheduled tasks

Reused, not duplicated:

startWinDriver
\eMatch Automation\RunEMatchCommand
✅ Standard toggle for next job

All Groovy pipeline files should include:

def RUN_NEXT_JOB = false
def NEXT_JOB = ''

This makes the chaining feature available for every suite.

To enable it:

set RUN_NEXT_JOB = true
fill NEXT_JOB with the full Jenkins job path
